\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L15\">第 15 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>返回 x 的平方根。</p>\n<p>特殊情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>sqrt(+inf)  = +inf</li>\n<li>sqrt(+-0)   = +-0</li>\n<li>sqrt(x)     = nan，如果 x &lt; 0</li>\n<li>sqrt(nan)   = nan\nTODO: 确定是否应直接在 @sqrt 内置函数中实现这些逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">sqrt</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.Sqrt\">Sqrt</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x))</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.sqrt.Sqrt\"><h3><code>std.math.sqrt.Sqrt</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">类型函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L81\">第 81 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>返回当操作数类型为 <code>T</code> 时，<code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt\">sqrt</a></code> 将返回的类型。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">Sqrt</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\"><h3><code>std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L36\">第 36 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">sqrt_int</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, value: T) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.Sqrt\">Sqrt</a>(T)</code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>value: T</code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>用法示例</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> sqrt_int {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u0</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/sqrt/#std.math.sqrt.sqrt_int\">sqrt_int</a>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u4</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.sqrt.std\"><h3><code>std.math.sqrt.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-igno